      "nvalence": "Valence electron count (s+d) for VEC and Miedema/Niessen z.",
      "molar_volume": "cm3/mol, Miedema V (Bakker 1998 Table A1); also used for the rule-of-mixtures density.",
      "work_function_phi": "V, Miedema phi* (Bakker 1998 Table A1) - verified against the book.",
      "n_ws": "density units, Miedema n_ws (Bakker 1998 Table A1) - verified against the book.",
